      "updated": 1789967776195,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "过期处理 · 持久状态扫描\n项目自研：ThreeFlows.tick → Recall.recover_expired\nSQLite 扫描到期的 accepted / running 请求并终止\nTemporal 仅为学习对象，未提供 Workflow Replay\ncontroller-runtime 参考属于 Operate，不执行此流程\n本步骤不自动从中断节点续跑 Recall",
      "originalText": "过期处理 · 持久状态扫描\n项目自研：ThreeFlows.tick → Recall.recover_expired\nSQLite 扫描到期的 accepted / running 请求并终止\nTemporal 仅为学习对象，未提供 Workflow Replay\ncontroller-runtime 参考属于 Operate，不执行此流程\n本步骤不自动从中断节点续跑 Recall",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
